        "title": "Rules and Policies",
        "id": "rules",
        "data": [
          "<ul><li>Hotels may charge a security deposit at the time of check in, which will be refundable if unutilized.</li><li>Check in & Check out time is for information purposes and may change without intimation.</li><li>Early Check in and Late check out are subject to availability and as per Hotel Policy.</li><li>Carrying valid ID proof and Voucher copy is recommended.</li><li>Any Supplementary charges / Gala Dinner / City Tax etc. to be paid directly at the property.</li><li>Bedding type is subject to availability at the time of check in.</li><li>Extra beds are not included in the reservation price unless stated in the hotel / booking policies.</li><li>Hotels may not allow any additional passenger apart from those reflecting in the booking.</li><li>Special Requests are subject to availability and cannot be pre confirmed / guaranteed.</li><li>Hotels may deny check in or charge a different amount if the nationality is different than mentioned at the time of reservation.</li><li>To avail any complementary service, guests need to contact the hotel directly. Hotel reserves the rights to accept, deny or withdraw the same.</li></ul>"
